    "body": "You should check window.console (we are only browser based right now). Old IES have no global console and the check will throw I think.\n\nAnd use console.log (olds IEs have no console.warn).\n\nSadly polyfill.io that we advise to use has no console polyfill, we might add one as a PR to them at some point.\n\nAlso I think at some point we will only console.\\* only for DEV purposes (so when NODE_ENV is set and equals to development). For now it's ok\n",
